<title>SINGAPORE: Thailand's Star Refining tenders to sell gasoline.</title>
<headline>Thailand's Star Refining tenders to sell gasoline.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's Star Petroleum Refining Co (SPRC) has issued a closed tender to sell 220,000 barrel of 92-octane unleaded gasoline for June 2-6 lifting, industry sources said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The tender will close on May 9 and would be valid for two days, they said.</p>
<p>The 130,000 barrels-per-day SPRC refinery is a 60:40 joint venture between Caltex and the Petroleum Authority of Thailand.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-870-3082)</p>
</text>
